{"url": "https://webaim.org/projects/salary", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\t\t<title>WebAIM: Global Digital Accessibility Salary Survey</title>\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/media/favicon.ico\">\n\t<link rel=\"home\" href=\"/\">\n\t<link rel=\"search\" href=\"/search/\">\n\t<link rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://webaim.org/blog/feed\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"WebAIM Blog\">\n\n\t<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-Y41PF8WV9X\"></script>\n\t<script>\n  \twindow.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  \tfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  \tgtag('js', new Date());\n  \tgtag('config', 'G-Y41PF8WV9X');\n\t</script>\n\t\n\t<link href=\"/styles/main.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/print.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\">\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/jquery.js\"></script>\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/main.js\"></script>\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Kameron:400,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/documents.css?ver=2\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\t\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400,400i,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style type=\"text/css\">\ntable {\n\tborder-spacing: 0;\n\tmargin:auto;\n\tmargin-bottom:20px !important;\n\twidth:90%;\n}\ncaption {\n\tpadding:5px 0;\n\tcolor:#3C3C3C;\n}\n\n[scope=\"row\"] {\n\tfont-weight:normal;\n\ttext-align:left;\n}\n\n[aria-label=\"A tabular representation of the data in the chart.\"] {\n\tdisplay:none !important;\n}\n\n</style>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/loader.js\"></script>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 9]>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://html5shiv.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/html5.js\"></script>\n<![endif]-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\" src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/loader.js\"></script><link id=\"load-css-0\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/css/core/tooltip.css\"><link id=\"load-css-1\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/css/util/util.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\" src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/js/jsapi_compiled_default_module.js\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\" src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/js/jsapi_compiled_graphics_module.js\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\" src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/js/jsapi_compiled_ui_module.js\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\" src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/charts/51/js/jsapi_compiled_corechart_module.js\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1069381703/?random=1774677522097&amp;cv=11&amp;fst=1774677522097&amp;bg=ffffff&amp;guid=ON&amp;async=1&amp;en=gtag.config&amp;gtm=45je63p1v899903185za200zd899903185xec&amp;gcd=13l3l3l3l1l1&amp;dma=0&amp;tag_exp=0~115616985~115938466~115938468~117484252&amp;u_w=1080&amp;u_h=600&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebaim.org%2Fprojects%2Fsalary%2F&amp;frm=0&amp;tiba=WebAIM%3A%20Global%20Digital%20Accessibility%20Salary%20Survey&amp;hn=www.googleadservices.com&amp;npa=0&amp;pscdl=noapi&amp;auid=1598495543.1774677300&amp;uaa=x86&amp;uab=64&amp;uafvl=Chromium%3B145.0.7632.6%7CNot%253AA-Brand%3B99.0.0.0&amp;uamb=0&amp;uam=&amp;uap=Linux&amp;uapv=&amp;uaw=0&amp;data=event%3Dgtag.config&amp;rfmt=3&amp;fmt=4\"></script></head>\n<body>\n\n\n<div id=\"headcontainer\" class=\"clearfix\" style=\"background-image: url(/media/banners/projects.jpg)\">\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<h2><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a></h2>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"hidden\">Main Navigation</h2>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/community/\">Community</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t<form method=\"get\" role=\"search\" action=\"/search/\" id=\"sitesearch\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"search\"><span><label for=\"q\">Search:</label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" id=\"q\"><input type=\"image\" src=\"/media/template/search.svg\" alt=\"Submit Search\"></span></p>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"intro\"><a href=\"/intro\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"training\"><a href=\"/services/training\">WebAIM Training</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"maincontainer\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<article id=\"maincontent\">\n\n<h1>Global Digital Accessibility Salary Survey</h1>\n\n<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span class=\"hidden\">You are here: </span><a href=\"/\">Home</a> &gt; <a href=\"/projects/\">WebAIM Projects</a> &gt; Global Digital Accessibility Salary Survey</p>\n\n<nav role=\"navigation\">\n<h2>Article Contents</h2>\n<ol>\n\t<li><a href=\"#intro\">Introduction</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#country\">Country</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#salary\">Salary</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#wages\">Wages</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#disabilitytypes\">Disability Types</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#industry\">Industry</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#size\">Company/Organization Size</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#status\">Employment Status</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#location\">Work Location</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#role\">Role</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#a11ycompany\">Accessibility Software, Tools, or Services Company</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#department\">Department</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#experience\">Years Experience</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#worked\">Years In Current Job</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#additional\">Additional Compensation</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#vacation\">Vacation Days</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#howapplied\">Application Type</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#understanding\">Recruiter Understanding</a></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n\n<script>\n/*\nThe charts and graphs are generated by Google Charts, which are very cool, but, \nunfortunately, have rather poor accessibility. We use scripting to define the \nchart container as an image with alt text (<div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Chart alt text\">). \nWe then hide the SVG chart contents so they are not read by a screen reader. \nThis allows us to provide basic accessibility to the charts. A data table provides \nthe full data for each chart.\n*/\n\n// Load the Visualization API and the corechart package.\ngoogle.charts.load('current', {'packages':['corechart']});\n\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(countryRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(disabilitiesRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(statusRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(locationRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(a11ycompanyRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(yearsexperienceRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(yearsworkedRegion);\ngoogle.charts.setOnLoadCallback(focusRegion);\n\n// Country\nfunction countryRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['United States', 309, '47.1'],\n\t\t['United Kingdom', 127, '19.4'],\n\t\t['Canada', 70, '10.7'],\n\t\t['Australia', 18, '2.7'],\n\t\t['India', 16, '2.4'],\n\t\t['Sweden', 16, '2.4'],\n\t\t['Other', 100, '15.2']\n\t]);\n\nvar options = {\n\t'width':720,\n\t'height':400\n};\n\nvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('country_div'));\nchart.draw(data, options);\n\n$(\"#country_div\").attr(\"aria-label\",\"Pie chart showing respondent countries.\");\n\n}\n\n// Disabilities\nfunction disabilitiesRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Response');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn({ type: 'string', role: 'style' });\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['Blindness', 8.2, 'red'],\n\t\t['Low Vision', 7.5, 'blue'],\n\t\t['Cognitive/Learning', 7.2, 'green'],\n\t\t['Deafness/Hard-of-Hearing', 5.2, 'IndianRed'],\n\t\t['Motor', 5.0, 'DarkCyan'],\n\t\t['Medical/Chronic Health', 13.4, 'darkorange'],\n\t\t['Neurodiverse', 29.6, 'darkred'],\n\t\t['Psychological/Psychiatric', 13.1, 'purple'],\n\t\t['Other', 6.3, 'GoldenRod'],\n\t\t['None', 41.5, 'darkgreen'],\n\t]);\n\n\tvar options = {\n\t\twidth:660,\n\t\theight:500,\n\t\ttitle:\"Disability Types (% of respondents)\",\n\t\tlegend: 'none',\n\t\tvAxis: {format:'#\\'%\\''}\n\t};\n\t\n\tvar chart = new google.visualization.ColumnChart(document.getElementById('disabilities_div'));\n\tchart.draw(data, options);\n\t\n\t$(\"#disabilities_div\").attr(\"aria-label\",\"Bar chart showing disability types.\");\n}\n\n// Status\nfunction statusRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['Full-time', 586, '90.6'],\n\t\t['Freelancer/Self-employed', 32, '4.9'],\n\t\t['Part-time', 21, '3.2'],\n\t\t['Other', 8, '1.2']\n\t]);\n\nvar options = {\n\t'width':720,\n\t'height':400\n};\n\nvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('status_div'));\nchart.draw(data, options);\n\n$(\"#status_div\").attr(\"aria-label\",\"Pie chart showing employment status.\");\n\n}\n\n// Location\nfunction locationRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['Remote', 361, '55.5'],\n\t\t['Hybrid', 245, '37.7'],\n\t\t['In Office', 44, '6.8']\n\t]);\n\nvar options = {\n\t'width':720,\n\t'height':400\n};\n\nvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('location_div'));\nchart.draw(data, options);\n\n$(\"#location_div\").attr(\"aria-label\",\"Pie chart showing work location.\");\n\n}\n\n//a11yCompany\nfunction a11ycompanyRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['Yes', 146, '22.5'],\n\t\t['No', 504, '77.5']\n\t]);\n\n\tvar options = {\n\t\t'width':660,\n\t\t'height':400,\n\t\tcolors: ['green', 'FireBrick']\n\t};\n\t\t\n\tvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('a11ycompany_div'));\n\tchart.draw(data, options);\n\t\n\t$('#a11ycompany_div').attr('aria-label', 'Chart showing respondents that work for an accessibility software, tools, or services company.');\n};\n\n// Experience\nfunction yearsexperienceRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['0 - 5', 238, '36.4'],\n\t\t['6 - 10', 216, '33.1'],\n\t\t['11 - 15', 77, '11.8'],\n\t\t['16 - 20', 65, '10.0'],\n\t\t['21 - 25', 43, '6.6'],\n\t\t['25+', 14, '2.1']\n\t]);\n\nvar options = {\n\t'width':720,\n\t'height':400\n};\n\nvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('yearsexperience_div'));\nchart.draw(data, options);\n\n$(\"#yearsexperience_div\").attr(\"aria-label\",\"Pie chart showing years of experience in digital accessibility.\");\n\n}\n\n// Experience\nfunction yearsworkedRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['0 - 5', 505, '77.3'],\n\t\t['6 - 10', 91, '13.9'],\n\t\t['11 - 15', 27, '4.1'],\n\t\t['16 - 20', 14, '2.1'],\n\t\t['21 - 25', 7, '1.1'],\n\t\t['25+', 7, '1.1']\n\t]);\n\nvar options = {\n\t'width':720,\n\t'height':400\n};\n\nvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('yearsworked_div'));\nchart.draw(data, options);\n\n$(\"#yearsworked_div\").attr(\"aria-label\",\"Pie chart showing years worked in current job.\");\n\n}\n\n// Experience\nfunction focusRegion() {\n\tvar data = new google.visualization.DataTable();\n\tdata.addColumn('string', 'Responses');\n\tdata.addColumn('number', '# of Respondents');\n\tdata.addColumn('string', '% of Respondents');\n\tdata.addRows([\n\t\t['None', 4, '.1'],\n\t\t['Nearly none', 31, '5.6'],\n\t\t['Most', 113, '20.5'],\n\t\t['Nearly all', 133, '24.1'],\n\t\t['All', 271, '49.1']\n\t]);\n\nvar options = {\n\t'width':720,\n\t'height':400\n};\n\nvar chart = new google.visualization.PieChart(document.getElementById('focus_div'));\nchart.draw(data, options);\n\n}\n\n</script>\n\n<div class=\"important\">\n\t<div class=\"title\">Important!</div>\n\t<p><a href=\"/projects/salary2/\">A more up-to-date version of survey results for 2026 is available.</a></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"intro\">\n<h2>Introduction</h2>\n<p>The report below provides the results of a survey conducted in December 2024 to collect salary and job-related data from professionals whose job responsibilities primarily focus on making technology and digital products accessible and usable to people with disabilities. 656 responses were collected.</p>\n\n<div class=\"note\">\n\t<div class=\"title\">Note</div>\n\t<p>This survey was conducted in conjunction with the <a href=\"https://gaad.foundation/\">GAAD Foundation</a>. The GAAD Foundation is a nonprofit organization whose mission is to disrupt the culture of technology and digital product development to include accessibility as a core requirement.</p>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://gaad.foundation/\" style=\"background:none !important; border:none !important;\"><img src=\"media/GAAD-Fdn-Logo.png\" alt=\"GAAD Foundation logo\" style=\"width:300px\"></a></p>\n</div>\n\n<p>A few disclaimers and notices:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Totals may not equal 100% due to rounding.</li>\n\t<li>Total responses (n) for each question may not equal 656 due to some respondents not answering a particular question.</li>\n\t<li>The sample was not controlled and may not represent everyone in the digital accessibility field.</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"country\">\n\n<h2>Country</h2>\n\n<div id=\"country_div\" class=\"chart\"></div>\n<table>\n\t<caption>Please select the country where you work.</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Country</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">United States</th><td>309</td><td>47.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">United Kingdom</th><td>127</td><td>19.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Canada</th><td>70</td><td>10.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Australia</th><td>18</td><td>2.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">India</th><td>16</td><td>2.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Sweden</th><td>16</td><td>2.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>100</td><td>15.2%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Responses were received from 30 different countries.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"salary\">\n<h2>Salary</h2>\n\n<p>Respondents that indicated working full time reported an average salary (after conversion to US dollars at January 2025 rates) of $109,542 US dollars (median = $96,100).</p>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Average full-time salary reported by location (where n&gt;10)</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Location</th><th scope=\"col\">Average Salary</th><th scope=\"col\">Median Salary</th><th scope=\"col\">Average Salary in US Dollars</th><th scope=\"col\">Median Salary in US Dollars</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">United States</th><td>$141,933 USD</td><td>$135,302 USD</td><td>$141,933</td><td>$135,302</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Canada</th><td>$124,017 CAD</td><td>$120,000 CAD</td><td>$85,572</td><td>$82,800</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">United Kingdom</th><td>\u00a365,450 GBP</td><td>\u00a356,207 GBP</td><td>$81,158</td><td>$69,697</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">EU</th><td>\u20ac54,626</td><td>\u20ac54,500</td><td>$56,810</td><td>$56,680</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Australia</th><td>$152,103 AUD</td><td>$144,000 AUD</td><td>$94,304</td><td>$89,280</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Sweden</th><td>484,000 SEK</td><td>498,000 SEK</td><td>$44,044</td><td>$45,318</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">India</th><td>3,120,557 INR</td><td>1,650,000 INR</td><td>$37,447</td><td>$19,800</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Average salaries varied by country.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"wages\">\n<h2>Wages</h2>\n\n<p>Respondents that indicated working full time and being paid hourly reported an average hourly wage (after conversion to US dollars at January 2025 rates) of $60.49 US dollars per hour (median = $55.76/hour).</p>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Average full-time wage reported by country (where n&gt;5)</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Country</th><th scope=\"col\">Average Wage</th><th scope=\"col\">Median Wage</th><th scope=\"col\">Average Wage in USD</th><th scope=\"col\">Median Wage in USD</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">United States</th><td>$73.08/hour</td><td>$65/hour</td><td>$73.08/hour</td><td>$65/hour</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Canada</th><td>$58.71 CAD/hour</td><td>$41 CAD/hour</td><td>$40.51/hour</td><td>$28.29/hour</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">United Kingdom</th><td>\u00a348.20 GBP/hour</td><td>\u00a355 GBP/hour</td><td>$59.77/hour</td><td>$68.20/hour</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"disabilitytypes\">\n\n<h2>Disability Types</h2>\n\n<div id=\"disabilities_div\" class=\"chart\"></div>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Which of the following disabilities do you have?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">Average Full-time Salary in US Dollars</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Blindness</th><td>54</td><td>8.2%</td><td>$129,744</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Low Vision/Visually-Impaired</th><td>49</td><td>7.5%</td><td>$114,458</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Cognitive or Learning</th><td>47</td><td>7.2%</td><td>$104,947</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Deafness/Hard-of-Hearing</th><td>34</td><td>5.2%</td><td>$119,617</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Motor</th><td>33</td><td>5.0%</td><td>$93,810</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Medical/Chronic Health-Related</th><td>88</td><td>13.4%</td><td>$112,037</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Neurodiverse</th><td>194</td><td>29.6%</td><td>$112,624</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Psychological/Psychiatric</th><td>86</td><td>13.1%</td><td>$114,654</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>41</td><td>6.3%</td><td>$104,304</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">None</th><td>272</td><td>41.5%</td><td>$104,267</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>57.6% of respondents reported having a disability. 149 respondents (23%) reported having multiple disabilities. The 319 respondents with disabilities (including Neurodiverse) that reported working full-time reported a higher average salary ($113,390) than the 234 respondents that did not report a disability ($104,267). Only respondents with Motor disabilities reported earning lower full-time salaries than respondents without disabilities.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"industry\">\n\n<h2>Industry</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>What industry do you work in?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">Average full-time salary (in USD)</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Information technology</th><td>171</td><td>26.1%</td><td>$110,407</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Education</th><td>81</td><td>12.3%</td><td>$92,896</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Government</th><td>77</td><td>11.7%</td><td>$93,704</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Finance</th><td>43</td><td>6.6%</td><td>$115,801</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Banking</th><td>35</td><td>5.3%</td><td>$104,496</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Professional and business services</th><td>33</td><td>5.0%</td><td>$121,304</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Healthcare and social assistance</th><td>25</td><td>3.8%</td><td>$166,082</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>191</td><td>29.1%</td><td>$112,938</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"size\">\n<h2>Company/Organization Size</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Approximately how many people work at your company/organization?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">1-10</th><td>30</td><td>4.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">10-100</th><td>71</td><td>11.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">100-500</th><td>66</td><td>10.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">500-1000</th><td>41</td><td>6.5%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">1000-10000</th><td>155</td><td>24.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">10000-20000</th><td>63</td><td>9.9%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">20000-50000</th><td>58</td><td>9.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">50000+</th><td>150</td><td>23.7%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>65% of respondents reported working at companies or organizations with over 1000 people. Employees of larger companies/organizations generally reported notably higher average salaries. For example, employees at organizations with fewer than 100 employees averaged full-time salaries of $75,845 compared to $124,016 for employees at organizations with 10,000 or more employees.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"status\">\n<h2>Employment Status</h2>\n\n<div id=\"status_div\" class=\"chart\"></div>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>How would you best describe your employment status?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Full-time</th><td>586</td><td>90.6%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Freelancer/Self-employed</th><td>32</td><td>4.9%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Part-time</th><td>21</td><td>3.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>8</td><td>1.2%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Respondents reported being paid to work an average of 37.7 hours per week.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"location\">\n<h2>Work Location</h2>\n\n<div id=\"location_div\" class=\"chart\"></div>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>What is your primary work location?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">Average full-time salary (in USD)</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Remote</th><td>361</td><td>55.5%</td><td>$115,570</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Hybrid</th><td>245</td><td>37.7%</td><td>$105,361</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">In Office</th><td>44</td><td>6.8%</td><td>$83,856</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Telework was by far the most common type of work with 93.2% of respondents indicating they work in remote or hybrid locations. In-office respondents reported notably lower salaries on average.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"role\">\n<h2>Role</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Which of the following best describes your current role?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Individual contributor</th><td>176</td><td>27.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Staff</th><td>131</td><td>20.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Manager</th><td>93</td><td>14.3%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Contractor/Consultant</th><td>79</td><td>12.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Team lead</th><td>70</td><td>10.8%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Director</th><td>36</td><td>5.5%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Chief Accessibility Officer</th><td>22</td><td>3.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Senior director</th><td>10</td><td>1.5%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Owner/work for myself</th><td>8</td><td>1.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Chief Executive Officer</th><td>6</td><td>.9&gt;%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Vice president</th><td>2</td><td>.3%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>22</td><td>3.4%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"a11ycompany\">\n<h2>Accessibility Software, Tools, or Services Company</h2>\n\n<div id=\"a11ycompany_div\"></div>\n<table>\n\t<caption>Do you work for a company that sells accessibility compliance monitoring software, accessibility automated testing tools, or digital accessibility professional services (e.g., audits, consulting)?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Yes</th><td>146</td><td>22.5%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">No</th><td>504</td><td>77.5%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Employees of accessibility companies reported notably lower full-time salaries ($87,279 on average) compared to others ($115,102 on average).</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"department\">\n<h2>Department</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>What part of your company/organization best describes where you work?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Digital Experience</th><td>110</td><td>16.8%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Information Services/Technology</th><td>93</td><td>14.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Engineering/Development</th><td>72</td><td>11.0%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Consulting Services</th><td>70</td><td>10.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Design</th><td>61</td><td>9.3%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Usability/User Experience</th><td>32</td><td>4.9%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Marketing/Communications</th><td>30</td><td>4.6%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Product</th><td>27</td><td>4.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>161</td><td>24.5%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"experience\">\n<h2>Years Experience</h2>\n\n<div id=\"yearsexperience_div\"></div>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>How many years of experience do you have in digital accessibility?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">0 - 5 Years</th><td>238</td><td>36.4%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">6 - 10 Years</th><td>216</td><td>33.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">11 - 15 Years</th><td>77</td><td>11.8%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">16 - 20 Years</th><td>65</td><td>10.0%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">21 - 25 Years</th><td>43</td><td>6.6%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">25+ Years</th><td>14</td><td>2.1%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>69.5% of respondents reported 10 or fewer years of experience in digital accessibility. Those with 10 or fewer years of experience reported notably lower full-time salaries ($100,933 on average) than those with more than 10 years experience ($129,934 on average).</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"worked\">\n<h2>Years In Current Job</h2>\n\n<div id=\"yearsworked_div\"></div>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>How many years have you worked in your current job?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">0 - 5 Years</th><td>505</td><td>77.3%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">6 - 10 Years</th><td>91</td><td>13.9%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">11 - 15 Years</th><td>27</td><td>4.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">16 - 20 Years</th><td>14</td><td>2.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">21 - 25 Years</th><td>7</td><td>1.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">25+ Years</th><td>7</td><td>1.1%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>22.2% of respondents worked in their current job for 1 year or less. 91.6% of respondents worked in their current job for 10 or fewer years. Those who worked longer in their current job generally have higher salaries and wages.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"focus\">\n<h2>Accessibility Focus</h2>\n\n<div id=\"focus_div\"></div>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>In your current job, what portion of your time focuses on making technology or digital products accessible and usable to people with disabilities?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">None of my time</th><td>4</td><td>.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Nearly none of my time</th><td>31</td><td>5.6%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Most of my time</th><td>113</td><td>20.5%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Nearly all of my time</th><td>133</td><td>24.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">All of my time</th><td>271</td><td>49.1%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Respondents that reported spending all or nearly all of their time focused on accessibility reported higher average salaries than those who spend less time.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"additional\">\n<h2>Additional Compensation</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Outside of your base pay/salary, choose all of the items that are part of your total compensation package.</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Equity</th><td>142</td><td>21.6%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Short term incentive/performance incentive/bonus/commission</th><td>282</td><td>43%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other allowance (e.g., rideshare costs, health club membership)</th><td>170</td><td>25.9%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Paid vacation</th><td>525</td><td>80%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Medical, dental, and/or vision benefits</th><td>461</td><td>70.3%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Employer-funded retirement benefits</th><td>423</td><td>64.5%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">None of these</th><td>51</td><td>7.8%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>92.2% of respondents reported additional compensation or benefits, with medical/dental/vision benefits and retirement benefits being most common.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"vacation\">\n<h2>Vacation Days</h2>\n\n<p>564 respondents (86%) reported receiving paid vacation with an average of at least 23 paid vacation days per year. 38 respondents reported having unlimited or flexible vacation leave.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"howapplied\">\n<h2>Application Type</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>How did you apply for or secure your current job?</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Online job board</th><td>274</td><td>42.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Internal job transfer/promotion</th><td>148</td><td>23.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Head-hunter/recruiting agency</th><td>84</td><td>13.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">I own my own business/work for myself</th><td>27</td><td>4.2%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Other</th><td>109</td><td>17%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"understanding\">\n<h2>Recruiter Understanding</h2>\n\n<table>\n\t<caption>Did you feel those who recruited or interviewed you for your current job had an understanding of digital accessibility and the work you would be doing? Please rate their level of understanding.</caption>\n\t<tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Response</th><th scope=\"col\"># of respondents</th><th scope=\"col\">% of respondents</th></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Excellent understanding</th><td>212</td><td>33.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Good understanding</th><td>202</td><td>32.1%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Not very good understanding</th><td>130</td><td>20.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">No understanding</th><td>55</td><td>8.7%</td></tr>\n\t<tr><th scope=\"row\">Not applicable</th><td>30</td><td>4.8%</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p>Most respondents (55.8%) indicated that their recruiter or interviewer had excellent or good understanding of digital accessibility.</p>\n\n</div>\n<script>\n$(document).ready(function(){\n\tsetTimeout(function(){\n\t\t$(\".chart div\").removeAttr(\"aria-label\");\n\t\t$(\".chart\").attr(\"role\",\"img\");\n\t\t$(\".chart div\").attr(\"aria-hidden\",\"true\");\n\t\t$(\".chart svg\").attr(\"aria-hidden\",\"true\");\n\t\t$(\".chart svg\").removeAttr(\"aria-label\");\n\t\t\n\t\t}, 1000);\n\n});\n</script>\n\n</article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t<div id=\"updated\">Last updated: <time datetime=\"2025-02-12\">Feb 12, 2025</time></div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"related\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Related Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/projects/salary2\">Global Digital Accessibility Salary Survey #2</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</a